message:
What to Bring to Your Wedding Florist Consultation

Bring:
• a few inspiration photos;
• your color palette;
• your venue details;
• your budget;
• a short list of flowers you love or want to avoid.

Florists think in images, and a clear brief gets a far more accurate quote than "something pretty and seasonal."

